gapt(){return"How do I change a member\u2019s role?"},
ganV(){return"Only the owner can do this. Open project settings, choose the group and tap Role on the member\u2019s card. Choose a new role and select Save changes. You can also change the role while the member\u2019s account is awaiting confirmation."},
ganW(){return"The new role applies across all groups in that project. Moving the person or adding them to another group in the same project does not change their role. Leaving without saving discards the change."},
gapO(){return"What is the difference between the owner and an Admin?"},
gaos(){return"The owner manages the project: they invite and remove members and change their roles. An Admin can view the calendar according to their role permissions, but does not become the owner or gain these project-management controls. The owner is not listed among editable members."},
